{
  "id": "erik_first_shift",
  "trigger": {
    "scene": "tweede_kans",
    "day": 5,
    "time": "evening"
  },
  "prerequisite": {
    "bar_level": "part_time"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "你来了。我还在想你会不会放鸽子。",
      "expression": "neutral"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "别紧张，今天晚上不忙。只是周二的常规晚班。",
      "expression": "warm"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "谢谢给我这个机会。",
      "expression": "grateful"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "不用谢我。我需要人手，你需要钱。这是生意，不是慈善。",
      "expression": "wry"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "不过说实话……这家店比你想象的老。很多东西是靠习惯而不是系统在运转。",
      "expression": "tired"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "你是说库存？",
      "expression": "curious"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "对。我现在靠脑子记，靠眼睛看。你知道这有多不可靠。",
      "expression": "self_deprecating"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "erik",
      "text": "如果你能帮我理一理库存，我会很感激。不是现在——你先熟悉一下环境。",
      "expression": "hopeful"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "accept_inventory",
      "text": "没问题，我可以帮忙整理库存。",
      "outcome": {
        "erik_affection": 1,
        "unlock_system": "bar"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_about_bar",
      "text": "这家店开了多久了？",
      "outcome": {
        "erik_affection": 1,
        "lore_unlock": "tweede_kans_history"
      }
    }
  ]
}
